Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:48:29 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920] | Words: 10 | Text: 别再信什么爱笑的人运气好了
Segment #2   [00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,020] | Words: 9  | Text: 为什么你穿的再贵也显土
Segment #3   [00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,660] | Words: 7  | Text: 因为你身上有窮像
Segment #4   [00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 今天我分享三条
Segment #5   [00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,000] | Words: 6  | Text: 能直接改你的面向
Segment #6   [00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,680] | Words: 1  | Text: 第一
Segment #7   [00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,280] | Words: 10 | Text: 别见人就笑那种讨好的笑
Segment #8   [00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 换不来尊重
Segment #9   [00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,380] | Words: 5  | Text: 只会让人觉得
Segment #10  [00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,320] | Words: 3  | Text: 你好拿捏
Segment #11  [00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,180] | Words: 3  | Text: 收脸一点
Segment #12  [00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,060] | Words: 3  | Text: 轻冷一点
Segment #13  [00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,480] | Words: 7  | Text: 气场反而立住了
Segment #14  [00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,200] | Words: 1  | Text: 第二
Segment #15  [00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 眼神要定
Segment #16  [00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,840] | Words: 7  | Text: 跟人说话别夺闪
Segment #17  [00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,080] | Words: 5  | Text: 只是对方眼睛
Segment #18  [00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,440] | Words: 5  | Text: 眼神漂护的人
Segment #19  [00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,620] | Words: 4  | Text: 心是虚的
Segment #20  [00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,140] | Words: 7  | Text: 地气自然就输了
Segment #21  [00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:27,560] | Words: 1  | Text: 第三
Segment #22  [00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,640] | Words: 4  | Text: 走路逮风
Segment #23  [00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,260] | Words: 6  | Text: 别总低头看地
Segment #24  [00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,120] | Words: 4  | Text: 太偷挺胸
Segment #25  [00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,500] | Words: 6  | Text: 不自卖的稳一点
Segment #26  [00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,440] | Words: 3  | Text: 老话说
Segment #27  [00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,640] | Words: 5  | Text: 体态脏运是
Segment #28  [00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:35,920] | Words: 5  | Text: 深姿挺拔了
Segment #29  [00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,200] | Words: 5  | Text: 贵气就出来了
Segment #30  [00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,680] | Words: 6  | Text: 这三条只是入门
Segment #31  [00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,140] | Words: 5  | Text: 真正的贵气
Segment #32  [00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,720] | Words: 8  | Text: 藏在你的嘴上和心里
Segment #33  [00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,060] | Words: 5  | Text: 下一期我告诉你
Segment #34  [00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,460] | Words: 4  | Text: 为什么话越少
Segment #35  [00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,300] | Words: 3  | Text: 命越好
Segment #36  [00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 点个关注
Segment #37  [00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,080] | Words: 3  | Text: 别滑走
